The wolf fell in love with Little Red Riding Hood

139
00:26:01,483 --> 00:26:06,703
偶然から始まる必然のワンシーン
A fateful scene beginning by coincidence

140
00:26:06,703 --> 00:26:11,073
どこに見えたのは揺れる赤色
What appeared somewhere was a swaying red color

141
00:26:11,553 --> 00:26:17,493
不思議の森の奥で見つかった黒歴史と何かが始まる予感
A dark history found deep in the mysterious forest and a premonition that something is beginning

142
00:26:17,613 --> 00:26:21,833
恐ろしくて抜け出した
Terrified, I slipped away

143
00:26:22,033 --> 00:26:26,673
出会いは偶然から続く
Encounters continue from coincidence

144
00:26:26,833 --> 00:26:32,053
だからわざと遠回りをした
That's why I purposely took a detour

145
00:26:32,513 --> 00:26:36,673
会いたいんだって触れたいんだって話したいんだって
I want to see you, I want to touch you, I want to talk to you

146
00:26:36,913 --> 00:26:42,073
笑えない可愛い君と随分僕が出会うそれが終わりさ
Meeting you, who are so cute yet unable to smile, that is the end of it all

147
00:26:42,273 --> 00:26:46,433
残酷だって呪いだって運命は変わらない
Cruel or cursed, fate cannot be changed

148
00:26:46,713 --> 00:26:51,633
ああどうして君がどうして僕が狼と赤ずきんなんだ
Ah, why are you, why am I, a wolf and Little Red Riding Hood?

149
00:27:01,489 --> 00:27:06,409
きっと君は今日もこの道を訪れる
Surely you will visit this path again today

150
00:27:06,709 --> 00:27:11,329
そして僕は今日のずっと見守るしかできない
And I can only watch over you all day today

151
00:27:11,629 --> 00:27:16,769
